{"id": "34502", "title": "鸦片的蝴蝶", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 47, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34502.htm", "intro": "厚，现在是怎样？穷有犯法吗？她是个穷留学生，当然要凡事斤斤计较，这公子哥干么一脸受不了的睥睨她，但后来她不过无意救了遇袭受伤的他，他竟向她求婚，不会是爱上她了吧？ㄜ……结果是她想太多了，他只是要场交易婚姻向父母交代了事，而他可以供给她优渥生活，两年为期，好，她决定答应，反正她也没损失，而且他那翘臀实在太对她的胃口，害她老是像欲求不满的色女猛盯著，新婚当天，还很没用的跟他滚到床上去，没办法嘛，谁叫他像鸦片，让人上瘾……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34502", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2188940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2188941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2188942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2188943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2188944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2188945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2188946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2188947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2188948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2188949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2188950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2188951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2188952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2188953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2188954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2188955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2188956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2188957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2188958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2188959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2188960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2188961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2188962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2188963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2188964.html", "availa